The incident has one root cause: ts-travel2-service, a slow application method. The data supports this, though I did not fully trace the mild preserve and travel tails, which I treat as downstream noise.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel2-service",
      "fault_kind": "application_method_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5),1) med_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel2-service' AND span_name LIKE 'Travel2Controller.%' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "Travel2Controller methods (getTripAllDetailInfo, queryInfo, getRouteByTripId) now take 3.7-11 s at p95, versus about 16-450 ms in normal."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "WITH sv AS (SELECT trace_id, span_id, span_name, duration FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel2-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND duration>1e9) SELECT sv.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(sv.duration/1e6),1) server_ms, round(avg(coalesce(ch.cdur,0)/1e6),1) child_ms FROM sv LEFT JOIN (SELECT trace_id, parent_span_id, sum(duration) cdur FROM abnormal_traces GROUP BY 1,2) ch ON ch.trace_id=sv.trace_id AND ch.parent_span_id=sv.span_id GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Slow travel2 server spans are almost entirely accounted for by a single internal controller span, not by DB or HTTP children.", },
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.5),1) med_ms, round(approx_quantile(duration/1e6,0.95),1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel2-service' AND span_name LIKE 'TripRepository.%' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1", "claim": "Travel2's database spans (TripRepository, SELECT Trip) stay near normal latency, so the slowdown is not in the database calls."},
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, round(avg(value),3) avg_v FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-travel2-service' AND metric IN ('container.cpu.usage','container.memory.usage','jvm.cpu.recent_utilization') GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Travel2 CPU, memory and JVM utilisation are low during the incident, so resource exhaustion is not the cause."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "ts-travel2-service", "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name psvc, c.service_name csvc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5),1) child_med_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-travel2-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Route-plan's outgoing calls to travel2 take a median of about 3.7 s in the incident, against about 27 ms normally."}]},
    {"from": "ts-route-plan-service", "to": "ts-travel-plan-service",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name psvc, c.service_name csvc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5),1) child_med_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Travel-plan's calls to route-plan rise to a median of about 14.9 s, carrying the travel2 delay upward."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel-plan-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name psvc, c.service_name csvc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.5),1) child_med_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "The UI's calls to travel-plan reach a median of about 15 s, so the user-facing dashboard shows the delay."}]},
    {"from": "ts-travel2-service", "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
     "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT p.service_name psvc, c.service_name csvc, count(*) n, round(approx_quantile(c.duration/1e6,0.95),1) child_p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id=p.span_id AND c.trace_id=p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-travel2-service' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "The UI calls travel2 directly for trip_detail and trips/left; those calls rise to p95 of about 18.8 s."}]}
  ]
}
```

